"w":0.21193414688110349,"h":0.01162790683971926},{"y":0.78924418615466208,"text":"4","x":0.10699588508244424,"w":0.012345678806304938,"h":0.0087209299193582446},{"text":"A","y":0.78924418614497216,"w":0.010288065671920782,"h":0.0087209299193581336,"x":0.13168724298708487},{"y":0.79214474861900264,"text":"is a place","w":0.065843620300292949,"h":0.0088261253309797061,"x":0.2695473248292774},{"w":0.17695472717285157,"y":0.80361871133481277,"text":"where parents leave their","h":0.011915269196822509,"x":0.12962963113236711},{"w":0.17342493057250979,"h":0.013913906262390197,"y":0.81620861951209744,"text":"small children when they","x":0.12937097576075146},{"x":0.43621399269589239,"text":"BIOLOGY","y":0.82267441852218925,"h":0.0072674418800401375,"w":0.037037036418914815},{"y":0.8311208277158384,"h":0.012176948843650504,"text":"go to work.","w":0.080403003692626956,"x":0.12955158543339795},{"h":0.010256521910139704,"text":"When you pass an exam","x":0.12757202538521212,"y":0.85029069794290024,"w":0.17078187942504885},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"x":0.12757201974270038,"text":"at the end of university,","y":0.86187113853810693,"w":0.16666666030883792},{"text":"CHEMISTRY","y":0.84593023249384625,"h":0.0072674418800400264,"x":0.42592592840472565,"w":0.061728391647338843},{"y":0.85304501335761374,"text":"MATHEMATICS -","w":0.078189296722412094,"x":0.34979424183083779,"h":0.0088735910400498108},{"y":0.86627906979232072,"w":0.063786005973815896,"h":0.0058139534198596854,"text":"MANAGEMENT","x":0.34567901337111673},{"text":"ECONUMICS","y":0.85901162791989993,"x":0.43415637906434484,"w":0.049382715225219698,"h":0.0072674418800401375},{"y":0.87063953500398372,"w":0.030864195823669394,"h":0.0087209299193582446,"x":0.42798354033405006,"text":"LITERATURE"},{"w":0.068180007934570297,"h":0.011145562275468257,"text":"you get a","y":0.8788748931778807,"x":0.12743263062355212},{"y":0.012030396225586437,"text":"EXERCISES","w":0.14869887351989741,"h":0.022450835117700296,"x":0.81659706533678222},{"h":0.01358002429500893,"w":0.059886441230773912,"text":"WORK","y":0.066611150530313412,"x":0.54310204641322346},{"x":0.54304734210646899,"y":0.087936746658178855,"text":"1 Complete the names of jobs with the missing letters.","w":0.41390609741210938,"h":0.01594660456792929},{"y":0.10755813978795237,"text":"'Some people think it's an unimportant job, but in my","w":0.36625514984130858,"h":0.013081394879037145,"x":0.59259258511020985},{"w":0.37242797851562492,"h":0.013244319151485273,"x":0.59053498395892279,"text":"case it's just the opposite - it seems I'm responsible for","y":0.12047661062814963},{"w":0.36625514984130858,"text":"everything - phone calls, emails, my boss's coffee and","x":0.59053497285712353,"y":0.1350397176758138,"h":0.013239187996469504},{"w":0.37242797851562504,"x":0.59053498565988294,"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.14960282431650129,"text":"even Christmas presents for his wife..'sesretary"},{"y":0.16424418634846039,"text":"1","x":0.56584362158790791,"w":0.010288065671920865,"h":0.0087209299193582446},{"text":"I've always been good at numbers, but it is not what","x":0.58436213622229749,"y":0.16416593095068488,"h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.37242797851562492},{"x":0.58847736692865749,"w":0.3539094543457032,"h":0.013081394879037256,"y":0.17732558141222554,"text":"people think: it's not that you only have to count in"},{"x":0.58847736782813298,"y":0.19186046530757439,"text":"this job. Calculators and computers count, but we","w":0.34567901611328122,"h":0.013081394879037256},{"text":"use intelligence to make good business decisions.'","y":0.20639534929013248,"w":0.35390945434570309,"x":0.58847737172975489,"h":0.013081394879037256},{"w":0.055555553436279381,"h":0.0072674418800401375,"text":"a-_--","x":0.58847736870367096,"y":0.2238372093288753},{"h":0.013239187996469615,"x":0.56378600380525323,"y":0.2338923212304056,"text":"2 1 make people happy in my job. My clients are","w":0.34773662567138675},{"x":0.5864197507543496,"y":0.24845542799342835,"w":0.35185184478759757,"text":"usually women. I make their skin look younger and","h":0.013239187996469504},{"text":"healthier. I also paint their nails and put their make-","x":0.58641975613598418,"y":0.26162790699362093,"w":0.35802467346191402,"h":0.013081394879037256},{"w":0.34609802246093757,"y":0.27385142659442452,"text":"up on before a special occasion like a wedding or","x":0.58620387228771587,"h":0.018222167443513682},{"y":0.28905560430795807,"h":0.016328331862312528,"w":0.27366254806518553,"text":"New Year's Eve party\/ b _._ _- _ _ ---","x":0.58847737243517118},{"text":"3 1 need to make a good first impression, because","w":0.36057922363281247,"h":0.0169115714656497,"y":0.30266998046036508,"x":0.563535505768609},{"w":0.33774185180664062,"text":"I'm the first person the customers see when they","x":0.58625520095471362,"y":0.31792369816210142,"h":0.015140203491103232},{"h":0.013239187996469615,"x":0.58641975201889229,"w":0.36419754028320306,"text":"enter the hotel. I greet the customers, answer phone","y":0.33274492477772999},{"w":0.34979423522949227,"x":0.58641976064314116,"h":0.013239187996469504,"text":"calls and emails, do the paperwork and accept the","y":0.34730803197493887},{"text":"payments.r________","x":0.58641975468644914,"h":0.014534883760080275,"w":0.18312757492065435,"y":0.36046511630794431},{"y":0.37334510118442854,"w":0.38065841674804679,"h":0.014736294220320856,"x":0.55967078686774618,"text":"4 'People call me or visit my office when they want to"},{"w":0.33744853973388678,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"buy, sell or rent a flat, a house or a piece of land.","x":0.58436214566803613,"y":0.38953488397399882},{"h":0.014679848148248298,"text":"I help them find the best offer and negotiate the","w":0.33744853973388667,"x":0.58230454000959986,"y":0.40247131490427246},{"x":0.58436214342272086,"w":0.36831275939941399,"y":0.41703442207615971,"text":"price. I don't have many clients in a month, but when","h":0.013239187996469504},{"x":0.58230452994934834,"h":0.013239187996469615,"text":"I sell or buy a house for someone, I earn a lot.\"","w":0.32510288238525398,"y":0.43159752872411461},{"y":0.44748455433523382,"w":0.088477363586425883,"x":0.5843621427266773,"h":0.010364282478406595,"text":"e _____ a"},{"text":"5","w":0.012345678806304883,"y":0.45930232573480911,"x":0.55967078185885033,"h":0.010174417958676241},{"x":0.56995885071760288,"y":0.46072374215039069,"w":0.35802467346191402,"text":"\"My job is very stressful. I often go to conferences","h":0.011659978662879711},{"text":"and have to speak in front of a lot of people.","w":0.31069957733154296,"x":0.58230452843813807,"y":0.47383720959173137,"h":0.013081394879037256},{"x":0.58230452832196022,"h":0.013081394879037367,"text":"I change a person's words from one language into","y":0.488372093214551,"w":0.34567901611328122},{"x":0.5823045289401334,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"another when they speak. I never do it in writing","y":0.50290697703359177,"w":0.33333332061767573},{"x":0.58230452951114675,"text":"because I think that's boring'","y":0.51588702553385235,"w":0.20576131820678711,"h":0.013239187996469504},{"y":0.54198190695052162,"x":0.55738828355946302,"h":0.017808861997626213,"text":"6 1 can work for a newspaper, a magazine, television","w":0.37493457794189444},{"w":0.36008228302001954,"h":0.011644584356107601,"text":"or radio. I like my job because every day is different.","x":0.58024691983258292,"y":0.55957634588061245},{"x":0.58024691342321322,"y":0.57267441878504532,"w":0.36419754028320306,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"I usually go to places where something interesting is"},{"h":0.016552668383767455,"x":0.58002167436366803,"y":0.58567536016241484,"w":0.36461151123046875,"text":"happening and then write a news report. This means"},{"x":0.57818929317409284,"h":0.010347605382880598,"y":0.60174418639372396,"text":"I have to travel a lot to collect information and then \/","w":0.3683127593994141},{"h":0.015175922929135832,"x":0.58004808661862373,"w":0.25564588546752931,"text":"work from home when I write.'j_.__","y":0.61331782206425933},{"x":0.55555555552140179,"h":0.0087209299193582446,"y":0.62936046512753019,"text":"7","w":0.012345678806304883},{"y":0.62930273590310248,"w":0.33950614929199219,"text":"'Summer is a busy time for me. I work ten hours","h":0.011685636121408161,"x":0.56995885385194645},{"w":0.31275718688964849,"h":0.011657413085371826,"text":"a day, seven days a week when it's warm and","x":0.57818930388027878,"y":0.64386584273274361},{"x":0.57818929548432796,"text":"sunny. I spend the whole day at the beach and","w":0.32510288238525387,"h":0.011629190049335603,"y":0.65842894948970998},{"x":0.57818930001214031,"y":0.67151162792385344,"w":0.34979423522949216,"text":"can sunbathe, which is great! But I can't fall asleep","h":0.013081394879037256},{"text":"because I'm responsible for the lives of all the people","y":0.68484469992565633,"w":0.37063964843750008,"x":0.57804076609857868,"h":0.014618327316728519},{"y":0.70058139565641164,"text":"swimming and playing in the water. I____","h":0.013081394879037256,"x":0.57818930748355457,"w":0.30658435821533203},{"w":0.39711933135986333,"h":0.013239187996469504,"text":"2 Match the verbs and noun phrases from the box to","y":0.71932921465810973,"x":0.52674896988248276},{"w":0.37242797851562492,"text":"make collocations. You can use some of them more","x":0.55349794024321641,"h":0.011666393027511823,"y":0.73546511642025669},{"y":0.74993731242015205,"w":0.080278625488281241,"h":0.010299793724874884,"text":"than once.","x":0.55348208743584115},{"x":0.57201646430422426,"y":0.77449249774986406,"w":0.34773662567138675,"text":"badly-paid a day off ajob fired from home","h":0.013298199646049946},{"text":"in debt a living","y":0.78905560475646064,"h":0.011915269196822509,"w":0.11522633552551265,"x":0.56995885061858786},{"text":"long hours night shifts overtime","x":0.68518518294997988,"y":0.78905560460494106,"w":0.25102880477905276,"h":0.013269976610013612},{"text":"o